# NASA's raw model download: 92 MB, and only an input to `npm run build:model`. Re-fetchable from
# github.com/nasa/NASA-3D-Resources. The 15 MB result in public/models/ *is* tracked — without it
# a clone cannot serve the 3D view.
data/nasa-models/iss-igoal-source.glb

# Process output of the 24/7 collector: these two are just stdout and stderr of a long-running
# process.
data/collect.out
data/collect.err

# The local collector's own logs.
#
# The campaign runs on Cloudflare — see worker/ — and has done since 11 August, a cron a minute
# writing to D1, which is what a record spanning weeks needs: it does not stop when this machine
# does. `npm run collect` holds a continuous session at 1 Hz and exists to cross-check that Worker,
# never to be the archive. Its logs are a scratch pad of whatever run is in progress, on the order
# of a hundred megabytes a fortnight, and they do not belong in the history of a static site.
data/collect-events.jsonl
data/collect-liveness.jsonl
